.TH WERKMEISTER-FEATURE-RESTART 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-feature\-restart \- Restart containers (\fBinfra <verb>\fR for shared infra)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister feature restart\fR [feature]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Useful after making code changes that hot\-reload doesn't pick up. If the feature doesn't have a slot, prints an error suggesting \fBwerkmeister feature up\fR instead.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
